From: Stoicoci Mihaita <stoicocimihaita@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: cs35l45: do not wake the DSP before it has entered hibernation

cs35l45_enter_hibernate() sends HIBERNATE without waiting for an
acknowledgement (bus activity would wake the part). When a stream starts
within tens of milliseconds after runtime suspend, OUT_OF_HIBERNATE is
reported successful at once, the firmware then finishes hibernating and
about 200 ms later all amplifiers raise "DSP Watchdog Timer"; the
protection algorithm stays dead (heartbeat frozen, RESUME rejected) until
the firmware is reloaded. On q706f PipeWire probing at session start hits
this window on every boot.

Keep the part in hibernation for at least 100 ms before waking it.
---
diff -ru a/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l45.c b/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l45.c
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l45.c	2026-11-20 09:39:39.376986213 +0200
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l45.c	2026-11-20 09:39:39.387639164 +0200
@@ -951,6 +951,9 @@
 			   CS35L45_UPDT_WKI2C_MASK);
 }
 
+/* Minimum time between HIBERNATE and OUT_OF_HIBERNATE */
+#define CS35L45_HIBERNATE_MIN_MS	100
+
 static int cs35l45_enter_hibernate(struct cs35l45_private *cs35l45)
 {
 	dev_dbg(cs35l45->dev, "Enter hibernate\n");
@@ -961,6 +964,7 @@
 
 	// Don't wait for ACK since bus activity would wake the device
 	regmap_write(cs35l45->regmap, CS35L45_DSP_VIRT1_MBOX_1, CSPL_MBOX_CMD_HIBERNATE);
+	cs35l45->hibernate_start = ktime_get();
 
 	return 0;
 }
@@ -969,8 +973,19 @@
 {
 	const int wake_retries = 20;
 	const int sleep_retries = 5;
+	s64 since_ms;
 	int ret, i, j;
 
+	/*
+	 * HIBERNATE is not acknowledged. Waking the firmware before it has
+	 * finished entering hibernation makes OUT_OF_HIBERNATE look successful
+	 * at once, the firmware then completes the hibernation and its watchdog
+	 * fires; the protection algorithm is dead until the DSP is reloaded.
+	 */
+	since_ms = ktime_ms_delta(ktime_get(), cs35l45->hibernate_start);
+	if (since_ms >= 0 && since_ms < CS35L45_HIBERNATE_MIN_MS)
+		msleep(CS35L45_HIBERNATE_MIN_MS - since_ms);
+
 	for (i = 0; i < sleep_retries; i++) {
 		dev_dbg(cs35l45->dev, "Exit hibernate\n");
 
diff -ru a/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l45.h b/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l45.h
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l45.h	2026-11-20 09:39:39.377248931 +0200
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/cs35l45.h	2026-11-20 09:39:39.387371656 +0200
@@ -505,6 +505,7 @@
 	unsigned int i2c_addr;
 	enum control_bus_type bus_type;
 	struct regmap_irq_chip_data *irq_data;
+	ktime_t hibernate_start;
 };
 
 extern const struct dev_pm_ops cs35l45_pm_ops;
